// The on-prem OCR nodes' problems, newest first (#296), from the nodes'
// workspace usnm-ocr-log-<env> (scripts/azure/logs.sh runs ocr-node-* queries
// there). Worker: its WARN and ERROR lines by message and kind, and any
// line that isn't JSON (a panic, a bad flag), from Syslog local0. System:
// everything at err and above, systemd's lines about
// usnm-ocr-worker.service, the nightly update's and the reboot window's
// Warning lines (#471) and the kernel's OOM kills, by process and
// message with digits masked. Each group shows its count, first and last
// time and one example, cut to 300 characters. No Syslog table yet (a new
// workspace) gives no rows, not an error.
let machines = "/providers/microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/";
let node_of = (id: string) { tolower(extract(@"(?i)/machines/([^/]+)$", 1, id)) };
let syslog = union isfuzzy=true
    (Syslog
    | where _ResourceId has machines
    | project TimeGenerated, Node = node_of(_ResourceId), Facility, SeverityLevel, ProcessName, SyslogMessage),
    (datatable(TimeGenerated: datetime, Node: string, Facility: string, SeverityLevel: string, ProcessName: string,
        SyslogMessage: string)[]);
let worker = syslog
    | where Facility == "local0"
    | extend j = parse_json(SyslogMessage)
    | extend Level = iff(isnotempty(tostring(j.level)), tostring(j.level), "TEXT")
    | where Level in ("WARN", "ERROR", "TEXT")
    | extend Message = iff(Level == "TEXT", replace_regex(substring(SyslogMessage, 0, 120), @"\d+", "N"),
        strcat(tostring(j.fields.message), iff(isnotempty(tostring(j.fields.kind)), strcat(" (", tostring(j.fields.kind), ")"), "")))
    | extend Example = substring(iff(Level == "TEXT", SyslogMessage,
        strcat(tostring(j.fields.page), " ", coalesce(tostring(j.fields.error), tostring(j.fields.cause)))), 0, 300)
    | summarize Count = count(), First = min(TimeGenerated), Last = max(TimeGenerated), Example = take_any(Example)
        by Node, Source = "worker", Level, Message;
let system = syslog
    | where Facility != "local0"
    | where SeverityLevel in ("err", "crit", "alert", "emerg")
        or SyslogMessage has "usnm-ocr-worker"
        or ProcessName in ("usnm-ocr-update", "usnm-ocr-reboot")
        or SyslogMessage has_any ("Out of memory", "oom-kill", "oom_reaper")
    | extend Message = strcat(ProcessName, ": ", replace_regex(substring(SyslogMessage, 0, 120), @"\d+", "N"))
    | summarize Count = count(), First = min(TimeGenerated), Last = max(TimeGenerated),
        Example = take_any(substring(SyslogMessage, 0, 300))
        by Node, Source = "system", Level = SeverityLevel, Message;
union worker, system
| project Last, First, Node, Source, Level, Count, Message, Example
| order by Last desc
